      "writtenOn": "2023-01-23T19:29:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do not think this would cause any issue, `k_event_clear` will only clear events that caused `k_event_wait` to return, even if an event is posted repeatedly within this window, it will be handled in current thread iteration.\n\nThe following conde inside driver\u0027s thread, will ensure only events posted are processed:\n```\n\t\tevents \u003d ap_pwrseq_wait_event(dev);\n\t\tif (!events) {\n\t\t\tcontinue;\n\t\t}\n```\nIs there a specific scenario you would like to cover?",
      "parentUuid": "a76953d5_49753bd6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 111,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 114,
